msgid "Radar has no analytics, no cookies, no accounts and no advertising. Your choices and anything you save stay in this browser: your saved items, the identities you viewed (off unless you turn it on), the names you gave, your settings and devnets, and a cache of recent answers so pages open quickly. A service worker keeps Radar’s own files so it can open offline."
msgstr "Radar has no analytics, no cookies, no accounts and no advertising. Your choices and anything you save stay in this browser: your saved items, the identities you viewed (off unless you turn it on), the names you gave, your settings and devnets, and a cache of recent answers so pages open quickly. A service worker keeps Radar’s own files so it can open offline."

msgid "Radar is a read-only explorer for Dash Core, Dash Platform and the network under both. It never signs, never broadcasts and never asks for a key."
msgstr "Radar is a read-only explorer for Dash Core, Dash Platform and the network under both. It never signs, never broadcasts and never asks for a key."

msgid "Radar keeps the last 300 proofs. Load the figure again to get its proof."
msgstr "Radar keeps the last 300 proofs. Load the figure again to get its proof."

