msgid "Radar only reads. To top up an identity, register a name, or work with a token, a contract or a Platform address, use Bridge. To vote on a proposal or as a masternode, use Governance. Each link opens in a new tab and carries the network you were looking at."
msgstr "Radar only reads. To top up an identity, register a name, or work with a token, a contract or a Platform address, use Bridge. To vote on a proposal or as a masternode, use Governance. Each link opens in a new tab and carries the network you were looking at."

msgid "Radar’s code is open source under the MIT licence. Where it adapts code or data from another project, that project is listed here and in the file it lives in. Libraries installed through npm and cargo keep their own licences."
msgstr "Radar’s code is open source under the MIT licence. Where it adapts code or data from another project, that project is listed here and in the file it lives in. Libraries installed through npm and cargo keep their own licences."

